{"title":"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There exist positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> with no <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_common_divisor\" title=\"Greatest common divisor\">common factor</a> greater than 1, such that\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6da2ed10da3db30008df596117c45ab02327603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A\\log_{1200} 2+B\\log_{1200} 3+C\\log_{1200} 5=D.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"332\" height=\"19\" /></center>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/7/ad7f2ceea020f06cf238532b1d71cdce47b0eb03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C+D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbfc46d671a6c76bee6aab5cd78f823c2ad5d723.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A\\log_{1200} 2+B\\log_{1200} 3+C\\log_{1200} 5=D\\]\" width=\"323\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying and taking the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">logarithms</a> away,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/5/6b586bc5cd578332a3cd1fdadbe28a9a27f3ca66.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^A \\cdot 3^B \\cdot 5^C=1200^D=2^{4D} \\cdot 3^{D} \\cdot 5^{2D}\\]\" width=\"284\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/790f6c0a674203f2b57202e5fe3308d013ad045a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=4D$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85ac5a80702d56577d4138e1ad27b0ed48ac3d2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=D$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/681f2ab4a80c2c7ab76a892cf13c5af4e78ce64a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=2D$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946d1d9e259a50091bdfdc7dcdb215da000a197c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe2fac3dab3afa8b1d414ed5eadeba8ec1aaf08f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f143a79ca17f293a6639e4af0593967f006e8d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/c/a5c03a46be6376bc33248033059e2c1dddd6adbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80a86e1acaed1861bcef6fa6dd99b5c3db29b537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b64a04f1bb5441f49280bc239eb2633307d30faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C+D=\\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST\">2006 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Proble